ata are TC-24 scope.（TFA-94700 AC 5）</li><li><b>U1a</b> No long-lived provider API key or credential (AWS, OpenAI, Google Vertex service account, Deepgram, SES) is present anywhere in client code: the web bundle and its served source maps, the iOS and And …（UAT OAT-05 step 1；TFA-94700 AC 5；TFA-94700 description ('No API keys client-side … UAT OAT-05 step 1')；TFA-94423 AC 1）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>等价类（equivalence） — 同一条规则换一类输入（医院 / 养老院、另一种数据）再验一次，每一类都要对。</p><p><b>Given </b>Local stack, fixture Hospital patient and Nursing Home resident, signed-in @roundai.test physician who has already accepted consent</p><p><b>When </b>The agent visits the Hospital chart, Add Patient, Tasks, the Handoffs inbox, Settings and the New template form, then the Nursing Home chart, Add Resident, Tasks and Settings opened from Nursing Home. It changes, generates, saves and deletes nothing.</p><p><b>Then </b>No visited screen shows an API key field or label, a key-shaped string, a model or vendor name or picker, a Test Connection button or a dictation engine choice. This holds in both modes. Screens not visited (patient detail sub-sheets, Dashboard) are not claimed.</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>oracle.mjs per checkpoint (case-insensitive). Every checkpoint mustNotContain 'API key', 'AKIA', 'sk-proj', 'BEGIN PRIVATE KEY', 'private_key', 'Test Connection', the model and vendor names a picker would show ('Haiku', 'Mistral', 'Gemini', 'Whisper', 'OpenAI', 'GPT-', 'Claude', 'Deepgram', 'Bedrock', 'Vertex'; TFA-94700 removed 'API keys (all providers); …</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U24；测试方法 AGENT · 浏览器 agent；矩阵里排的车道 浏览器 agent（automated）</p><p><small>S03 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/OAT-05.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AGENT · 浏览器 agent；辅助：STATIC · 静态检查（构建产物 / 扫描） — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> OAT-05 Keeping Data Secure / Real-PHI Readiness Gate · <b>Section:</b> B · Operational Acceptance Tests · <b>Scenario:</b> OAT-05/S03</p><p><b>Main screens in both modes (charts, Add, Tasks, Handoffs, Settings, template form): no API-key field, key string, model picker or engine choice</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-94423 Implement GPT-live medical mode for active dictation (ready for qa); TFA-94700 Physician Settings &amp; AI Consent (store requirements) (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U24.rejudged.verdict.json</code>), unit U24 split by its parts' checkpoints. Agent: 100 turns, 227 s, $0.60.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U24 (#24, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — Screen tour: forms, settings, Ask sheets. Same legacy seed, read-only screen tour. OAT-05 S03 already opens Add Resident and the chart tabs; TC-03 S11 (Add Resident fields) and TC-15 S13 (Ask sheets open from Encounter and Post-Round, no question) look at the same screens. Nothing is saved. Runs together with TC-03/S11, TC-15/S13.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #24, U24; checked: yes): <b>Fail (known) after re-judge</b> — OAT-05 S03 first failed only on a 'Facility' anchor (field not built) — case fixed, saved evidence re-judged: no key/vendor/model/engine text on any visited screen (Pass). TC-03 S11: no Facility on the NH Add form (known, TFA-92581 AC 3 / C1). TC-15 S13: Ask AI reachable on Encounter + Post-Round (Pass)</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["OAT-05 Keeping Data Secure / Real-PHI Readiness Gate","S03 Main screens in both modes (charts, Add, Tasks, Handoffs, Settings, template form): no API-key fiel…"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"9bac8672bf821e2a0b6ae0b735a692ca","originalFileName":"4eaeb052-b170-4972-af6e-8cc024b70cb9-attachment.txt","